{
  "uid": "aether-fleet-conversations",
  "title": "Aether Fleet Conversations",
  "description": "What the agent fleet is saying and doing: every Hermes session, T3 turn, A2A hop, approval and herdr state change in one stream, shipped by aether-fleet-feed.",
  "tags": ["aether", "hermes", "fleet"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_VICTORIA_LOGS",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "source",
        "type": "custom",
        "label": "source",
        "query": "hermes,t3,a2a,approver,herdr",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "hermes",
            "value": "hermes",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "t3",
            "value": "t3",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "a2a",
            "value": "a2a",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "approver",
            "value": "approver",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "herdr",
            "value": "herdr",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "agent",
        "type": "custom",
        "label": "agent",
        "query": "hermes-main,hermes-k8s,hermes-home,hermes-aether,t3,herdr",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "hermes-main",
            "value": "hermes-main",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "hermes-k8s",
            "value": "hermes-k8s",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "hermes-home",
            "value": "hermes-home",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "hermes-aether",
            "value": "hermes-aether",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "t3",
            "value": "t3",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "herdr",
            "value": "herdr",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "search",
        "type": "textbox",
        "label": "search (LogsQL word filter, * for all)",
        "query": "*",
        "current": {
          "text": "*",
          "value": "*"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "*",
            "value": "*",
            "selected": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Events by source",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "_stream:{source=~\"${source:regex}\", agent=~\"${agent:regex}\"} AND ${search:raw} AND _time:$__range | stats by (source) count() events",
          "queryType": "stats"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": true
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Events by agent",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "_stream:{source=~\"${source:regex}\", agent=~\"${agent:regex}\"} AND ${search:raw} AND _time:$__range | stats by (agent) count() events",
          "queryType": "stats"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": true
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Approvals: allowed / denied / escalated",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "_stream:{source=\"approver\"} AND _time:$__range | stats by (decision) count() n",
          "queryType": "stats"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": true
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Activity over time (events per 5 min, by agent)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "_stream:{source=~\"${source:regex}\", agent=~\"${agent:regex}\"} AND ${search:raw} AND _time:$__range | stats by (agent) count() events",
          "queryType": "statsRange",
          "step": "5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{agent}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Conversation feed (oldest at the bottom; click a line for every field: session, tools, thread, model)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 26,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "_stream:{source=~\"${source:regex}\", agent=~\"${agent:regex}\"} AND ${search:raw} AND _time:$__range | sort by (_time) desc | limit 2000",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "maxLines": 2000
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showLabels": false
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Waiting on Jan: approval requests not yet resolved, escalations",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_VICTORIA_LOGS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "_stream:{source=~\"approver|t3\"} AND kind:in(\"escalated\", \"escalation_pending\", \"approval.requested\") AND _time:$__range | sort by (_time) desc | limit 200",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "maxLines": 2000
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "prettifyLogMessage": false
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading the feed",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Sources: **hermes** = every agent's session store (user, assistant, tool calls `\u21e2`, tool results `\u21b3`; the *chat* field is the Matrix room, the A2A peer, the webhook route or the cron job) \u00b7 **t3** = T3 Code thread messages and tool/approval activities \u00b7 **a2a** = hermes-aether's inbound/outbound audit \u00b7 **approver** = t3-approver decisions \u00b7 **herdr** = agent state transitions on aether.\n\nSame stream in a terminal on aether: `aether-fleet-feed tail --since 2h [--agent hermes-main] [--source t3] [--grep text] [--follow] [--full]`.\n\nPer-line fields worth opening: `session`, `title`, `thread`, `url`, `tools`, `model`, `request_id`, `decision`, `peer`."
      }
    }
  ]
}
